"OPNsense by HTTP-JSON" (github.com/zabbix/community-templates,
Network_Devices/OPNsense/template_opnsense_by_http_json), which carries the
notice above. The greater part of the current content was added on top of it:
the packet filter and kernel sections, service, swap and temperature discovery,
the dashboard, and the corrections listed in the README.

